{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026mL8hOYfGl21794497209.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>上周六有一名菲律賓籍男子，被襲擊後在中環街頭暈倒，本周二傷重不治，案件改列為謀殺。</p><p></p><p>該名男子被送往瑪麗醫院治理，周二下午近2時半不治。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.MURDER-2200_002.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026Qh3TEzexE01794497220.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>警方上周六接報，指一名男子在中環康樂廣場對暈倒，到場調查後，相信事主與兩名同鄉因為瑣事起爭執，其後被他們以拳腳襲擊。兩名施襲男子上周日涉嫌傷人被捕，現正被扣留調查。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-12T15:43:55.466183+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":150,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-12T13:35:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-12T19:37:41.651111+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-12T15:37:16.835025+00:00","content_hash":"868c71e50dce00dfcc0a671b906454b09388a65fe6e0aaaf904d7766fdb40448","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-12T15:43:55.466183+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}